update public.contextos set contenido='<p><strong>Useful Things</strong></p><p>Few things are (0) <strong>better</strong> than having anything you love in your garage. I am a single father and I (16) ______ look after two teenagers; both of them are special and friendly. My car has become a very useful thing when it comes to (17) ______ them to the museum or to the department store. (18) ______ their friends in these places is important for them.</p><p>However, the (19) ______ important thing on my list is my cell phone. I (20) ______ shopping and bought a modern one two months ago. It is (21) ______ and useful since I use it as an alarm clock to wake up (22) ______ 5 o&rsquo;clock. I can (23) ______ check information on the web and send text messages to my colleagues.</p>' where id='6e9d8b5f-ef4d-464a-9af2-e295fb1a94af' and contenido in ('<p><strong>Useful Things</strong></p><p>Few things are (0) <strong>better</strong> than having anything you love in your garage. I am a single father and I (16) ______ look after two teenagers; both of them are special and friendly. My car has become a very useful thing when it comes to (17) ______ them to the museum or to the department store. (18) ______ their friends in these places is important for them.</p><p>However, the (19) ______ important thing on my list is my cell phone. I (20) ______ shopping and bought a modern one two months ago. It is (21) ______ and useful since I use it as an alarm clock to wake up (22) ______ 5 o&rsquo;clock. I (23) ______ check information on the web and send text messages to my colleagues.</p>','<p><strong>Useful Things</strong></p><p>Few things are (0) <strong>better</strong> than having anything you love in your garage. I am a single father and I (16) ______ look after two teenagers; both of them are special and friendly. My car has become a very useful thing when it comes to (17) ______ them to the museum or to the department store. (18) ______ their friends in these places is important for